# Checksums of the saved weight-3/2 bases read by DualTest.m (ReadWeightThreeHalvesBasis), one file
# basis_<M>_<B>.txt per level M and precision B: the cusp forms of weight 3/2 on Gamma_0(M) with the
# theta^3 multiplier, one per row, coefficients 1..B, as a Magma matrix literal.  They are not in
# git (up to 330 MB); they live in DUALW_CACHE (default ~/dualw) and are to be deposited on Zenodo.
# Written by tools/proof-*/basisS.m or ReadWeightThreeHalvesBasis(M, B : Compute := true); computed
# on lovelace 2026-10-26 to 2026-11-06 (the levels near 8000 took 50 to 100 hours each).
